# 12 October 2026: task MI-other, iteration on the "other" stem of the onekey-pro-2 music benchmark (private, 1:1).
# The shared modules (resynth, sms, eventdev, transcribe) are imported read-only; nothing here edits them.
# Pipeline of one candidate (a pure function of a params dict and a note list, every reference-derived quantity is a
# number: notes, timbre tables, per-event dev tables, residual and eq tables, never a sample):
#   1. transcription of the reference "other" stem (this file, section "transcription"): CQT, per-note templates
#      learned from isolated notes of the stem itself, NMF with those fixed templates, note tracking; pyin on the
#      monophonic segments; onset-aligned retiming;
#   2. timbre tables per voice by sms.analyse_stem (measured, calibrated), per-event dev tables by eventdev.fit_stem;
#   3. residual bed, per-bar eq, automation (resynth helpers), stereo;
#   4. score with the independent third-octave critic (Scripts/MusicCritic.py, compare()).
# FR : iteration sur la piste "other" ; modules partages en lecture seule ; transcription NMF CQT a gabarits appris,
# pyin sur les segments monophoniques, recalage des attaques, puis timbres, ecarts par note, residu, egaliseur.
